[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1143.43, "timestamp": "00:19:03", "text": "然后他说：“是啊，我只是……”，我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1151.51, "timestamp": "00:19:11", "text": "然后我就想，“哦，我喜欢这样。”所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1154.63, "timestamp": "00:19:14", "text": "是的，我最终还是制作了《我的世界》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1157.11, "timestamp": "00:19:17", "text": "皮肤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1159.43, "timestamp": "00:19:19", "text": "那很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1161.91, "timestamp": "00:19:21", "text": "太酷了。啊，那太酷了。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1165.189, "timestamp": "00:19:25", "text": "甚至还有我自己的皮肤，给运动健将用的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1167.35, "timestamp": "00:19:27", "text": "加入 Minecraft。但《我的世界》就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1169.99, "timestamp": "00:19:29", "text": "一款有趣的游戏。不，这太有趣了。是的，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1172.31, "timestamp": "00:19:32", "text": "是。是的，尤其是如果你和……一起玩的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1175.03, "timestamp": "00:19:35", "text": "你和朋友们在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1177.75, "timestamp": "00:19:37", "text": "没错，没错，没错。比如，如果你有你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1179.91, "timestamp": "00:19:39", "text": "拥有自己的服务器，然后你就可以，你知道的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1182.35, "timestamp": "00:19:42", "text": "炫耀一番。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1185.43, "timestamp": "00:19:45", "text": "现在说到Minecraft，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1188.39, "timestamp": "00:19:48", "text": "还有一些定制的东西，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1190.709, "timestamp": "00:19:50", "text": "figura 或其他什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1193.189, "timestamp": "00:19:53", "text": "呃，你知道这件事吗？像定制一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1195.27, "timestamp": "00:19:55", "text": "比如你可以长出尾巴之类的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1198.31, "timestamp": "00:19:58", "text": "龙尾巴之类的。是的，是的"}]